00:00:09.914 --> 00:00:14.308
stick around until the end to find out more.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.550
Cryptids are undoubtedly some of my favourite
creatures from folklore, having already covered

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:11.970
the likes of the Mothman, the Jersey Devil,
the chupacabra and the loch ness monster it’s

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:19.820
about time we return to North America, home
to hundreds hundreds of unique and strange creatures.

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:25.320
What better place to start than with none
other than Bigfoot, a creature that is said

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:29.850
to roam the forests of the United states and
Canada.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:36.170
Bigfoot is also referred to as sasquatch and
the most common description is a large hairy

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:43.170
ape-like or humanoid creature that stands
anywhere between 6 to 10 feet tall.

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:51.760
The name bigfoot originates from a group of
men working for a logging company out of California in 1958.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:57.870
During several jobs they noticed heavy equipment
and material being moved around, once they

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:04.010
established it was none of them they assumed
it was some kind of prank.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:09.890
A man called Jerry Crew came across a set
of 16inch footprints that he thought were

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:18.540
human, the rest of the workers began to see
these footprints and assumed they belonged to this mysterious prankster.

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:24.660
They started calling this mysterious figure
Bigfoot, eventually their story as well as

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:33.250
a cast of the footprint would appear in a
local newspaper and thus the legend of bigfoot was born.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:38.610
Mentions and depictions of creatures similar
to bigfoot go back centuries and can be traced

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:42.080
back to several native American tribes.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:52.430
Those native to California carved images of
wild and hairy men that are now compared to the modern idea of bigfoot.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:58.000
Many Alleged sightings often occur in north
west America but spread across the entirety

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:05.170
of North America especially in rocky and forest
dense areas like the Great Lakes region.

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:13.150
Most of these claims are explained as hoaxes
or animals such as large bears being mistaken for bigfoot.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:19.060
Those who claim to have seen bigfoot describe
a range of varying behaviour, from throwing

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:26.410
rocks and branches at people, Hanging the
bones of animals from trees to mark said territory

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:31.800
and of course chasing those pesky trespassers
away.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:36.780
The majority of these sightings happen when
it’s dark which naturally makes bigfoot

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:44.260
even harder to identify but have also led
to the idea that bigfoot is a nocturnal creature.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:50.200
Stories from indigenous tribes speak of these
figures as something to be feared but also

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:54.349
respected, they aren’t malicious or malevolent.

00:03:54.349 --> 00:04:00.599
We do see this with many stories surrounding
bigfoot; it's often him defending his territory

00:04:00.599 --> 00:04:04.810
as opposed to him going out of his way to
attack someone.

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:07.680
Despite all the hysteria, the hoaxes.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:15.650
the sceptics and alleged sightings, we are
no closer to finding bigfoot, but one thing is for sure.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:25.410
There is no shortage of people willing to
continue this search and who knows maybe one day they may find what they’re looking for.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:31.539
We find ourselves back in West Virginia this
time taking a look at the devil dogs, also

00:04:31.539 --> 00:04:35.580
known as the white things and Sheepsquatch.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:41.770
Most reported sightings of these creatures
happen around the southern counties of west virginia.

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:50.949
their appearance varies from Demonic dogs
to something that is more akin to a Yeti or Sasquatch that crawls on all fours.

00:04:50.949 --> 00:05:00.259
Commonly they are described as a creature
the size of a bear with white fur, a long pointed head and saber-like teeth.

00:05:00.259 --> 00:05:06.270
Much like the Mothman they are also thought
to have come from the TNT area in mason county

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:13.457
Those who claim to have been attacked say
that if felt as real as anything they had experienced before,

00:05:13.457 --> 00:05:17.373
they felt the fangs and claws tearing into their flesh

00:05:17.373 --> 00:05:26.789
but when the attack was over and they looked down there were no marks, no blood and nothing to even suggest they have been attacked in the first
place.

00:05:26.789 --> 00:05:33.569
The first reported sighting of the white things
came in 1973 with a family were driving by

00:05:33.569 --> 00:05:39.240
point pleasant, the seven year old boy in
the back told his parents he saw something

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:44.199
with thick shaggy white hair that was about
three feet wide.

00:05:44.199 --> 00:05:49.129
The family then said the creature appeared
right beside their car floating in the air

00:05:49.129 --> 00:05:53.340
following them for several minutes before
disappearing.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:59.629
Sightings continued over the years along the
roadside but mostly in heavily wooded areas.

00:05:59.629 --> 00:06:08.490
The last recorded encounter was in 2015 when
six campers came across something on top of a hill at around midnight.

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:14.210
Shining their torches in its direction they
revealed a creature over nine feet tall that

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:19.930
was charging down the hill, the only thing
separating them was a small river.

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:25.520
The creature stalked around for several minutes
looking for a way across but when it couldn’t

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:29.289
find one it jumped in and began to swim across.

00:06:29.289 --> 00:06:34.289
The group ran back to their camp, gathered
their belongings and fled.

00:06:34.289 --> 00:06:40.819
They reported it to the locals but not the
authorities for fear of not being believed,

00:06:40.819 --> 00:06:47.419
it does just sound like a story made up by
kids high on shrooms in the forest.

00:06:47.419 --> 00:06:53.770
For the next creature we head to Maumee Valley
in Northern Indiana where we find the Beast

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:57.240
of Busco, an enormous snapping turtle.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:06.189
This story begins in 1898 in a small Indiana
town known as Churubusco or Busco for short.

00:07:06.189 --> 00:07:14.110
A farmer named Oscar Fulk came across a giant
turtle living in a lake on his farm, he told

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:21.879
others in the town but no one would take him
seriously and so he decided against pursuing the turtle any further.

00:07:21.879 --> 00:07:28.860
50 years later two locals reported seeing
a turtle that must have weighed close to 500

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:34.389
pounds whilst they were out fishing in what
had become known as Fulk lake.

00:07:34.389 --> 00:07:39.330
The owner of the farm at the time had also
reported seeing the giant turtle and as word

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.330
began to spread sightings became more common.

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:47.699
The story became national news and groups
of curious people visited the town in hopes of seeing the monster turtle.

00:07:47.699 --> 00:07:53.199
For a town of just over a thousand people
this had a pretty big impact, the amount of

00:07:53.199 --> 00:08:00.539
people driving to the farm caused so much
traffic the state police were called in to offer assistance.

00:08:00.539 --> 00:08:05.819
Those who came to see the turtle were extremely
disappointed and questioned whether it was

00:08:05.819 --> 00:08:13.650
just a clever ploy by the then owner Gale
Harris to drive tourism to the town and his farm.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:19.879
In an effort to clear his name Harris had
most of the lake drained but the turtle nicknamed

00:08:19.879 --> 00:08:24.879
Oscar after the original farm owner was nowhere
to be seen.

00:08:24.879 --> 00:08:29.559
Several attempts to find him may have also
been unsuccessful but the town still likes

00:08:29.559 --> 00:08:35.899
to remember Oscar as every June they hold
a festival in his memory.

00:08:35.899 --> 00:08:42.789
A giant turtle in all honesty isn’t that
weird but the same can’t be said for Ohio

00:08:42.789 --> 00:08:48.240
frogman also known as the Loveland frog and
the Loveland lizard.

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:54.959
This cryptid is described as a 4ft tall frog
that has been seen all around Loveland Ohio.

00:08:54.959 --> 00:09:06.310
This legend began in 1955 when a man walking
by the road reported seeing three frog-like men with webbed feet and hands.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:13.250
This could have been easily brushed off as
just another drunk but reported sightings continued.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:19.350
Whilst driving at 3,30 am a man noticed three
reptilian creatures by the side of the road.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:26.980
At first he thought they were humans in costumes
but then he noticed they had leathery skin like a frog.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:33.290
It gets stranger because one of them held
up what he called a wand and when sparks began

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:36.630
to shoot out he quickly drove away.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:42.500
Could this wand have been a firework being
held by someone in a costume?

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:51.990
Possibly but I’d like to believe this man
saw three giant frog wizards practicing magic on the roadside at 3 in morning.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:56.170
Interest in the Frogmen peaked once again
when the Loveland police, themselves almost

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.100
killed an animal that matched its description.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:05.829
In 1972 officer Ray Shockey was driving when
an animal ran across his vehicle, ahead of

00:10:05.829 --> 00:10:13.930
him he described a creature that was between
3 to 4 feet tall and between 50 to 75 pounds.

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:21.970
He said it was crouched like a frog and eventually
stood up on two feet to climb over the guard rail and head back down to the river.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:29.920
Two weeks later officer Mark Mathews reported
seeing the same unidentified animal along the same roadside.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:34.250
Mathews pulled out his rifle and shot the
animal dead.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:40.019
Upon examining the corpses he identified it
as a large Iguana that had a missing tail

00:10:40.019 --> 00:10:48.730
which is why both men struggled to recognize
it in the first place.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:59.319
We’re going back to West Virginia and the
town of flatwoods in Braxton county for our

00:10:59.319 --> 00:11:06.839
next cryptid, the flatwoods monster also known
as the Braxton county monster.

00:11:06.839 --> 00:11:17.440
This cryptid is said to be 10feet tall and
4 feet wide, it has a red face, a pointed hood and a dark metallic body.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:24.370
It was first seen in 1952 by three young boys
who witnessed a bright object fly across the

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:28.230
sky and crash on the land of a local farmer.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:37.870
They told a woman named Kathleen May what
they had seen, she and three of the local boys visited the farm to see if the story
was true.

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:46.880
They reached the top of the hill where the
boys said the object had landed and ahead of them was a pulsating red light.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:54.870
When they pointed their flashlights in it’s
direction they saw a tall man with a round face and a pointed hood.

00:11:54.870 --> 00:12:05.009
Kathleen describes the monster as having small
claw or toy-like hands, a pointed hood and a head that resembles the ace of spades.

00:12:05.009 --> 00:12:10.470
One of the boys said its eyes emitted a green
light and had a dark green body.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:18.769
After looking for a few seconds the creature
began to move, it made a hissing noise as it glided towards them.

00:12:18.769 --> 00:12:26.589
As it got closer all of them recalled an extremely
pungent smell, a thick mist that burnt their eyes and nose.

00:12:26.589 --> 00:12:32.160
They panicked and ran away before they could
see the creature up close.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:37.980
The sheriff and his deputy had been investigating
reports of an aircraft that had crashed but

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:43.170
when they visited the area the morning after
they couldn’t see or smell anything.

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:48.850
There were several investigations carried
out and what happened that night has been

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:55.879
explained in numerous ways, the bright light
in the sky was most likely a meteor.

00:12:55.879 --> 00:13:02.209
The pulsating red light could have been an
aircraft hazard beacon and the creature with

00:13:02.209 --> 00:13:07.089
the glowing eyes and small claws could have
just been an owl.

00:13:07.089 --> 00:13:16.834
This still hasn’t stopped people from claiming
they’ve seen the flatwoods monster as well experiencing the smell for themselves.

